      "content": "MARLOWES 1. 5252                                                   Nos 57 and. 59 TL 0507 1/196 II                       GV 2. Early C19.  Colour washed brick, hipped low pitched Welsh slated roof with eaves cornice.  2 storeys, colour washed pebbledash to front.  2 sash windows with glazing bars.  Included for group value. Nos 45, 53 to 59 (odd) and Nos 63 to 67 (odd) form a group. Listing NGR: TL0556107282"
    }
